OL,3,GNEWSAHeating oil customers face tough
OL,4,Awinter
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome people say they are finding it
OL,7,Fhard to heat their homes after
OL,8,Fincreases in heating oil costs fuelled
OL,9,Fby the US-Israeli war with Iran.
OL,11,FResidents in the South West told the
OL,12,FBBC they have held off buying fuel for
OL,13,Fthe winter in the hope prices could
OL,14,Fcome down and feared some people might
OL,15,Fgo without.
OL,17,FIt comes as the government announced
OL,18,Fnew measures aimed at regulating the
OL,19,Fmarket and reviewing the minimum
OL,20,Famounts some people have to buy.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
