OL,3,GNEWSAHeating oil customers face tough
OL,4,Awinter
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeating fuel costs have risen by up to
OL,7,F82% since the start of the conflict,
OL,8,Faccording to the Minster for Energy
OL,9,FConsumers Polly Billington.
